C00000" font-family="Microsoft JhengHei,Microsoft JhengHei_MSFontService,Arial" font-weight="700" font-size="18" x="59.1667" y="0">有明示</tspan><tspan font-family="Microsoft JhengHei,Microsoft JhengHei_MSFontService,Arial" font-weight="700" font-size="18" x="114.167" y="0">的觀點</tspan><tspan font-family="Microsoft JhengHei,Microsoft JhengHei_MSFontService,Arial" font-weight="700" font-size="18" x="169.167" y="0">—</tspan><tspan font-family="Microsoft JhengHei,Microsoft JhengHei_MSFontService,Arial" font-weight="700" font-size="18" x="188.958" y="0">找支持觀點的理由</tspan><tspan font-size="18" x="0" y="26">•</tspan><tspan font-family="Microsoft JhengHei,Microsoft JhengHei_MSFontService,Arial" font-weight="700" font-size="18" x="22.5" y="26">文章</tspan><tspan fill="#C00000" font-family="Microsoft JhengHei,Microsoft JhengHei_MSFontService,Arial" font-weight="700" font-size="18" x="59.1667" y="26">沒有明示</tspan><tspan font-family="Microsoft JhengHei,Microsoft JhengHei_MSFontService,Arial" font-weight="700" font-size="18" x="132.5" y="26">的觀點</tspan><tspan font-family="Microsoft JhengHei,Microsoft JhengHei_MSFontService,Arial" font-weight="700" font-size="18" x="187.5" y="26">-</tspan><tspan font-family="Microsoft JhengHei,Microsoft JhengHei_MSFontService,Arial" font-weight="700" font-size="18" x="195.417" y="26">從</tspan><tspan font-family="Microsoft JhengHei,Microsoft JhengHei_MSFontService,Arial" font-weight="700" font-size="18" x="213.75" y="26">文章中的理由</tspan><tspan font-family="Microsoft JhengHei,Microsoft JhengHei_MSFontService,Arial" font-weight="700" font-size="18" x="323.75" y="26">/</tspan><tspan font-family="Microsoft JhengHei,Microsoft JhengHei_MSFontService,Arial" font-weight="700" font-size="18" x="331.875" y="26">實例，提取合</tspan><tspan font-family="Microsoft JhengHei,Microsoft JhengHei_MSFontService,Arial" font-weight="700" font-size="18" x="22.5" y="48">理的觀點。</tspan><tspan font-size="18" x="0" y="74">•</tspan><tspan font-family="Microsoft JhengHei,Microsoft JhengHei_MSFontService,Arial" font-weight="700" font-size="18" x="22.5" y="74">區辨文章觀點和理由之間的連結是否適當</tspan></text></g></svg>